Strike your opponent in the knee (or other critical point in an ambulatory appendage) for [167%, 175%, 180%, 185%, 190% (TL1-5)] weapon damage, knocking them down ([1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] turn pin) and slowing their movement by [42%, 44%, 46%, 48%, 50% (TL1-5; CUN 100)] for [3, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns afterwards.

This shot will bypass other enemies between you and your target.

The slow effect becomes more powerful with your Cunning.
